.TP
\fB\-\-settings\fR \fI<value>\fR
The settings to change. Omitted settings stay as they are; null clears one to the runtime default. subAgents replaces every speaker and must include `main`. Required.
.TP
\fB\-\-settings.modalities\fR \fI<value>\fR
One of: call, chat. Repeatable. Optional.
